{"symbol":"SBVCL","yahoo":"SBVCL.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Shri Balaji Valve Components Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Specialty Industrial Machinery","website":"https://www.balajivalvecomponents.com","about":"Shri Balaji Valve Components Limited engages in the manufacturing of ready-to-assemble valve components in India, Africa, Asia, North America, South America, Europe, Australia, and internationally. The company offers ball, butterfly, and gate valve components; stem, trunnion plate, packing gland, body adaptor, stem housing, body, one piece TMBV ball, seat ring, lifting lug, gear box flange, ISO pad, actuator stem, flange bonnet, spring button, discs, piston rod, glande flange, retainer rings, and sleeve; and forging products, such as bonnet, clamp, coupling, eblow, hinges, eblow tee, inner ring, ISO pad, trunnion and plate, and ball. It serves oil and gas, petrochemical, power generation, pharmaceutical, and defense sectors. Shri Balaji Valve Components Limited was founded in 1989 and is based in Pune, India.","updated":"2026-09-30T12:14:55+00:00","quote":{"price":129.0,"prevClose":135.75,"marketCap":105.26,"high52":152.25,"low52":60.3,"pe":13.23,"bookValue":64.83,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":17.6,"shares":0.816,"insiders":73.53,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2024-01-03","2024-01-04","2024-01-05","2024-01-08","2024-01-09","2024-01-10","2024-01-11","2024-01-12","2024-01-15","2024-01-16","2024-01-17","2024-01-18","2024-01-19","2024-01-23","2024-01-24","2024-01-25","2024-01-29","2024-01-30","2024-01-31","2024-02-01","2024-02-02","2024-02-05","2024-02-06","2024-02-07","2024-02-08","2024-02-09","2024-02-12","2024-02-13","2024-02-14","2024-02-15","2024-02-16","2024-02-19","2024-02-20","2024-02-21","2024-02-22","2024-02-23","2024-02-26","2024-02-27","2024-02-28","2024-02-29","2024-03-01","2024-03-04","2024-03-05","2024-03-06","2024-03-07","2024-03-11","2024-03-12","2024-03-13","2024-03-14","2024-03-18","2024-03-19","2024-03-20","